# ⭐ OPIc Sample Answer - Day15

I remember when I first entered university.

At that time, I was excited but also a little nervous because everything was new to me.

I met many new people and had to get used to a completely different environment.

At first, I had trouble managing my time, but I gradually learned how to balance my classes and personal activities.

After that, I became more comfortable with university life.

Looking back, I think that experience helped me become more independent and responsible.
